    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this fantastic three-bedroom semi-detached family home with a spacious garage conversion currently used as a fourth bedroom. \r\nThis property is ideally positioned within the highly sought-after estate of Cill Cais, Oldbawn, Dublin 24. Proving to be one of Dublin 24's most sought-after addresses, the location is truly next to none. Within a brisk walk you will find a variety of shops, shopping centres, primary & secondary schools and leisure facilities. On a transport note a host of bus routes serving Dublin's City Centre and both The Luas & The M50 Motorway are very easily accessible by car.\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 113 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, large living room with fireplace, fully fitted kitchen, dining room, separate utility room and immaculately converted garage with a downstairs fully tiled bathroom. \r\nOn the first floor you have three generous bedrooms and a main family bathroom that comes fully tiled. Two bedrooms boast built in wardrobes. The rear benefits from a private well maintained east facing garden featuring a paved seating area ideal for hosting, two large wooden sheds great for additional storage whilst the front offers plenty of off-street parking on a quiet road. \r\nNo. 46 comes to the market in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with plenty of additional features such as fully fitted kitchen, gas fired central heating, fully tiled bathroom & built-in wardrobes, mixture of wooden and tiled flooring throughout to name but a few. Prime for a wide range of buyers such as 1st time buyers looking to get on the property ladder or any growing family looking to settle roots in a highly sought-after area and this one is not to be missed; \r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers for further information or to arrange viewing! \r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 113 sqm \r\n- BER E2\r\n- 3 bed / 2 bath \r\n- Semi-detached family home \r\n- Garage conversion \r\n- Currently acting as 4th bedroom \r\n- Fantastic condition throughout \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Entrance porch \r\n- Large living room\r\n- Separate dining room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Three generous bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Two tiled bathrooms\r\n- Top quality flooring \r\n- Gas fired central heating \r\n- Double glazed windows\r\n- Top quality blinds \r\n- Well maintained rear garden \r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Paved garden area\r\n- Two wooden sheds for storage \r\n- Off street parking to front \r\n- Located on peaceful road \r\n- Not much passing traffic \r\n- Mature and sought-after development \r\n- Bus routes within walking distance \r\n- M50 Motorway & The Luas within easy reach \r\n- Prime for a wide range of buyers \r\n- Viewing highly advised! \r\nDirections D24 YH2T"
      },
      {
